TranslationUnitDecl
|-ClassTemplateDecl Tuple
| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 ... Ts
| `-CXXRecordDecl struct Tuple definition
|   `-VarDecl size 'const unsigned long' static cinit
|     `-SizeOfPackExpr 'unsigned long' Ts
`-ClassTemplateDecl Seq
  |-NonTypeTemplateParmDecl referenced 'int' depth 0 index 0 ... Ns
  `-CXXRecordDecl struct Seq definition
    `-FieldDecl arr 'int[sizeof...(Ns)]'
